{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_6_level_main_06-04_end","groupId":"main_6","stageId":"main_06-04","title":"溃烂的疮疤","storyCode":"6-4","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-04_end.txt","sourceHash":"8421f19a82a5a834750de81027170d586b4157d7ebd47cf16c9c8f45e9be5dfd","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第四关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"外面已经乱作一团了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"听说梅菲斯特用法术变出了会袭击自己人的怪物，那些东西连感染者都吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，这场仗我们已经彻底打输了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"梅菲斯特留下的一支小队，刚才才有人在贫民区一间房的地下室里找到他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"据说尸体上长满了植物，已经快认不出来了。你有头绪吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不太清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"真奇怪啊，怎么四处都是怪事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"切尔诺伯格打得下来，却攻不破龙门，果然还是因为塔露拉没来吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"不和弑君者他们一起走好像也是选对了，通讯频道里已经完全搜不到他们的消息了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"这里就只剩我们这么点人，似乎也做不成什么事，哎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢，你怎么说，龙门的感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，龙门人。其实不加入整合运动，你可能也不至于变得和我们一样惨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不加入，我们的处境也不会变好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"......你是不是听了塔露拉的演讲才加入的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，口号对我没有吸引力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你会这么问我......似乎你也对感染者的身份政治不感兴趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，看来你确实不信那套。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那为什么你还留在整合运动？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"因为除了整合运动，我也没其它地方能去啊。不过，是不是我们不来，你们就还能正常过活？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对感染者的清洗总会发生，整合运动只是会加速龙门的这个过程。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"你看得还挺清楚的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"也是。你说的没错。我的故乡，一座挺偏远的小城市，原本对感染者还算不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"统治我们的贵族有个感染者女儿，在他的自治领里面，我们感染者能在隔离区里正常生活，矿役也不算特别重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"非患者对我们也没多好，但至少也会和我们进行交易，做点小买卖什么的，偶尔还能蹲在墙边一起喝点酒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"过了几年以后，好像是因为带兵打输了，伯爵被带走，新的市长上任了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“大叛乱”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是那段时间，被削爵是很正常的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"可能是吧，政治之类我不懂，都是后来有一句没一句的听来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"他们说有的地方有感染者信使，但乌萨斯肯定没有，我们什么事都不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"起初大家还像以前一样过着日子，只是偶尔觉得氛围很沉重，食品供应商那的进货也越来越少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"慢慢地，气氛不大对了。物资短缺的时候，非患者开始向我们丢石头，身边也不断有感染者失踪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"十几场市政厅演说过后，已经没人提他贪污拨款和私自改造下城区的事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，这事我们感染者都知道，普通市民真能一点都不知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"在隔离墙的边上，我们也能听见“除掉感染者，净化城市”之类的口号了。向隔离区里面这么喊的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们成了他私欲的牺牲品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"物尽其用嘛，反正我们不一直都是牺牲品吗？就算我说之前我们城待感染者不错，其实也就好过那么几十年而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"后面的事就很简单了，大多数感染者都被杀了。我们逃到荒野里，没吃没喝，又死了一大半。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"这回在龙门，再死了一批。我的同乡已经死完了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你说的对。这种事总会发生，感染者就是没地方能活。之所以还抱侥幸心理，都是因为事情没发生在眼前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你和我说这些做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"觉得自己没多少时间可活了啊。你会不会那种无痛的杀人方法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你在说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起？我可能会错意了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"龙门人依然会痛恨你们，你们入侵了我们的城邦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。可感染者哪有城邦呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？起火了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，别扯我......你说一声，我会给你让开窗户前的位置啊，用不着那么暴力吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"火势蔓延得很迅速。奇怪，这不像是自然滋生的火灾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"为啥？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它没有像“真正的火”那样蔓延。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"那我们赶紧撤离吧，谁知道接下来这里会变成什么样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"看情况。那个，你要不要和我们走？你们龙门人离开故乡也有点难受吧。但你可以和我们一起离开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要不要和你们走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"对啊。没事，我就问问，不愿意就算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我考虑一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，故乡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪里才是故乡？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合运动成员"]}]}
